        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Poubaomei khuan tei nking o Kandimei guai le;",
            "Kamei guangnipui gan tang the Aniu ta lakhang.",
            "",
            "Guang puthe, guang puthe",
            "Muang rukhou dung lana",
            "Himdaina keimei hou puni the.",
            "",
            "2. Kakhou lumloumei guai nata Lathau kanpui tang",
            "Loudumei maansei guai tei mu Mansuang puni the.",
            "",
            "3. Rianramei maikuam lung khou tei Tingkum ching akha",
            "Tingsaeng rianra na khaeng puni, Lumlou makmei guai.",
            "",
            "4. Kakhou lumloumei guai tei mu Neikum gaan puni;",
            "Neilamei kimdat pulak khe Poubaomei hukhou."
          ]
        }
      }
